Dataset license
Created: 2026-09-21

The data in this directory — keystroke timings, response texts, extracted key
pairs and aggregate features from 61 participants — is made available under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

You may share and adapt it for any purpose, including commercially, provided
you give appropriate credit. Full license text:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Attribution
-----------
Credit the dataset by citing the paper it was collected for:

  Kuruvilla, A., Pickering, L., Rentala, I., and Kumar, R. "Context-Robust
  Identity Linkage in Social Media via Keystroke Dynamics." Proceedings of the
  IEEE International Conference on Tools with Artificial Intelligence (ICTAI),
  2026.

The BibTeX entry and, once the proceedings are published, the DOI and page
numbers are in the repository's root README and CITATION.cff.

A request that is not a license condition
-----------------------------------------
Participants took part on the understanding that their data would be published
in anonymized form. Participant IDs are random and carry no identifying
information. We ask that you do not attempt to re-identify participants or to
link these records to other data about individuals.

The code in this repository is licensed separately, under the MIT license in
the repository root.
